{
    "title": "NoBroker Rent, Buy, Sell Flats",
    "description": "Introducing the NoBroker App - the ultimate property app for hassle-free property renting, buying, & services. Whether you are looking for a house/apartment/flat/room for rent, or want to buy/sell a property or need home services, NoBroker has got you covered. \r\nFind the property of your choice with zero brokerage with our house & plot sale app. Our app helps you find the perfect home, calculate rent, manage rent payments & more. You can also use the app to buy & sell plots, find commercial properties for rent or sale. It is a comprehensive property buying & selling application. \r\nFEATURES \r\n\ud83c\udfe0 Find housing in leading cities: The NoBroker housing app simplifies the process by providing a user-friendly interface, extensive options & special filters for advanced property search. Browse through 1000s of verified listings with accurate property information like property photos, amenities, & location in the cities of Bangalore, Mumbai, Delhi, Chennai, Hyderabad, Pune, Gurgaon, Noida, Greater Noida, Faridabad, Ghaziabad. \r\n\ud83d\udd0e Advanced filters for extensive property search by your requirements, such as property type, budget, area, number of rooms & more. Find a home that suits you, be it a single room, a PG, a full house, or a shared flat. \r\n\ud83d\udcb5Buy/Sell your property with ease without having to deal with brokers & middlemen. This property sale & purchase app & property selling app in India makes it easy to buy & sell properties. Make plot buying & selling a process of just a few clicks. Get dedicated property management services. Use our free EMI calculator & avail the best home loan assistance service from NoBroker. Put up your commercial shop for sale & watch it get scooped up in no time! \r\n\ud83d\udcc3NoBroker Rental Services provides Instant rental/lease agreements with 1-day delivery & accurate estimate of your property value & property rent with our property rent calculator. Know everything about your commercial shop for rent before you pay the rent. \r\n\ud83d\udcb3 Pay rent online with your credit card & get amazing rewards & cashback in return while paying your- Home/Shop/office/commercial property rent School, college or tuition fees Property token amount/security deposit Society maintenance charges \r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0fNoBroker Home Services like- Painting: Get your home painted in no time from nearby painters in your locality. Cleaning & Sanitization services: Professional home cleaning services near you at the best-quoted price in the market. AC Service & Repair: Get summer-ready with perfectly working ACs Home maintenance: Book Electricians, Carpenters & Plumbers at your convenience. \r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0fNoBroker Interior Design: Consult the best interior designers in India to renovate your home within your budget. \r\n\ud83d\udcbcNoBroker Personal Loans to secure Your Financial Needs. Flexible Repayment Plans: Meet your pressing financial requirements easily. Affordable Interest Rates: No more financial worries \u2013 our manageable rates make meeting commitments easy. Quick Approval: Swift processing to meet your urgent financial needs. Minimal Documentation: Streamlined documentation process for a hassle-free application. The Annual Percentage Rate (APR) ranges from 10.99% & 30 %, depending on period of repayment & credit score of loan applicant. The repayment schedules are adjustable from 3 months to 5 years (with provision of instant foreclosure subjected to terms & conditions). \r\n\r\nExample-  \u20b91,00,000 loan with 24-month repayment period, at 18% APR & \u20b91,500 processing fee + \u20b9270 GST would have \u20b94,992 monthly EMI payments. You will be sanctioned \u20b998,230 & \u20b919,817 is the total interest, which you will have to pay over the principal amount, therefore the entire amount due on the loan is \u20b9119,817.\r\n\r\nNoBroker has partnered with RBI-authorized & regulated NBFCs/Financial Institutions.\r\n\r\nOur Partner NBFCs - \r\nKisetsu Saison Finance (India) Private Limited\r\nFor more information, Contact us: The Fore, Chikkabellandur, Bengaluru, KA-560087",
